  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals one third x minus 14\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals negative x plus 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>18</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><em>.</em> What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
